    "Six bodies have been recovered from the site of a major blaze at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia candy factory in Cikande, Banten.",
    "Banten Regional Police report that approximately 50 employees remain unaccounted for following the incident.",
    "Ongoing search efforts led by joint emergency teams are currently hindered by lingering flames and significant structural collapses."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A severe fire broke out at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia candy production facility located in Cikande, Serang Regency, Banten. As of November 22, 2026, the situation remains critical as search and rescue operations continue amidst ongoing fire hazards. Six bodies have been successfully evacuated from the site by joint emergency response teams, including Basarnas. Local authorities have established an identification post for families awaiting news regarding missing workers, whose numbers have been reported as high as 50 by the Banten Regional Police. Rescuers are currently facing significant logistical challenges, primarily due to the extensive area of the industrial site and the danger posed by collapsed building structures that impede access to the affected zones. Families of the employees have gathered near the facility premises in anticipation of official updates regarding their missing relatives.",
